OL,3,AReform UK mayor investigated over naked
OL,4,Aphoto claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's Hull and East Yorkshire
OL,7,Felected mayor Luke Campbell is under
OL,8,Fpolice investigation for allegedly
OL,9,Fsharing naked images of himself.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Hull and East
OL,12,FYorkshire Combined Authority (HEYCA)
OL,13,Fsaid: "The mayor firmly denies the
OL,14,Fallegations.
OL,16,F"We recognise the seriousness of the
OL,17,Fmatters reported and understand the
OL,18,Fconcern they have caused among our
OL,19,Fstaff, partners and the wider public.
